title: 23 - Glitched Ending

cover_description: The title text sits at the top, above the gamebox interface, in a off-blue background and yellow-and purple text.

cover: cover.jpg

-- synopsis
Gameboy chiptune that glitches out when it loops back to the first part of the song

(See downloads for the Strudel code).
-- synopsis

--more
More LSDJ chiptunes. Went crazy modifying the instruments this time, came out with cool effects IMO. If you skip to ~0:59 when it loops over, one of the instruments glitches out,
but it sounds cool as hell. Not sure why it does that then and not at the beginning of the loop though.
--more